WEBVTT

00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:11.440
Stand, my husband-to-be!

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:13.840
Stand straight and proud!

00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:16.440
That whelp!

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:18.430
He goes too far!

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:27.760
Nobunaga!

00:00:36.790 --> 00:00:37.840
I've been had!

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:42.770
The fool-brat has better endurance than I do.

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:47.770
Nobunaga?

00:00:48.110 --> 00:00:49.810
What's wrong, Nobunaga?!

00:00:50.210 --> 00:00:50.880
Hey!

00:00:58.620 --> 00:00:59.600
Wait!

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:00.790
Shingen!

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:03.260
The Takeda forces are retreating...

00:01:03.260 --> 00:01:04.690
We're saved!

00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:05.760
Nobu-sama...

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.370
It appears both units have 
reached their operational limit.

00:01:08.370 --> 00:01:09.200
Nobu...

00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:11.670
It was a most fruitful banquet.

00:01:12.630 --> 00:01:14.750
Why did Lord Shingen retreat?

00:01:16.330 --> 00:01:18.340
My betrothed!

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:22.300
You have done well with your first Regalia.

00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:23.960
You make me proud!

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:09.250
Huh, so this is the famous Ameno Torifune.

00:03:10.060 --> 00:03:12.800
How much did it cost to build?

00:03:12.800 --> 00:03:15.330
This vessel has been passed down 
for generations in Yamatai.

00:03:15.780 --> 00:03:18.460
None alive can build anything like it now.

00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:20.300
Wow!

00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:24.330
Hey, this ship's heading 
toward the Oda castle, right?

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:28.490
I hope you are not deceiving 
us and returning to Yamatai.

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:30.080
Please rest assured.

00:03:30.610 --> 00:03:33.080
This vessel follows the ley line's flow.

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:35.130
Although our course is roundabout,

00:03:35.130 --> 00:03:37.860
we are certainly going to Owari.

00:03:38.510 --> 00:03:41.100
So this is the technology of a star

00:03:41.100 --> 00:03:43.190
with ley line riddled lands...

00:03:43.190 --> 00:03:44.920
By the way, where is Nobunaga?

00:03:44.920 --> 00:03:46.390
Nobunaga-sama is over there.

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:48.390
What?

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:49.420
Oh?

00:03:49.420 --> 00:03:51.020
They're on deck.

00:03:51.480 --> 00:03:52.360
An outdoor tea ceremony?

00:03:55.070 --> 00:03:57.640
It is a wife's duty to support her husband,

00:03:57.640 --> 00:03:59.520
no matter what the circumstance.

00:04:06.610 --> 00:04:11.030
Do you think Nobu-sama will really 
marry the Queen of Yamatai?

00:04:11.030 --> 00:04:11.980
Marry...

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:14.960
A new-model Giant War Armor from the West,

00:04:14.960 --> 00:04:16.450
and the Queen of Yamatai.

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:18.690
Nobu has drawn both to him 
through his presence...

00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:21.220
through his potential.

00:04:26.470 --> 00:04:28.930
Himiko-sama and Nobunaga are to wed?

00:04:29.570 --> 00:04:30.670
Yes, my lord.

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:32.200
Nobunaga-sama is to wed

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:33.990
Queen Himiko of Yamatai,
 an empire in the Land of Origins.

00:04:34.490 --> 00:04:38.830
They have exchanged vows of 
betrothal with a Regalia.

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:43.280
I believe forging marital 
ties with the Yamatai

00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:45.020
will be to our nation's advantage.

00:04:45.540 --> 00:04:47.740
If we gain Yamatai's support,

00:04:47.740 --> 00:04:50.130
neighboring nations will 
not attack us without good reason.

00:04:50.810 --> 00:04:53.350
And we can strengthen our 
defenses in the meanwhile!

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:54.770
I knew it!

00:04:55.570 --> 00:04:59.590
I thought you cowards would 
be talking about worthless crap!

00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:03.790
Nobunaga-sama, I believe we 
agreed to let me handle this.

00:05:06.470 --> 00:05:08.470
Our neighbors won't attack?

00:05:08.470 --> 00:05:09.990
Strengthen our defenses?

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:11.420
Idiots!

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:15.320
I would use the Giant War 
Armor and Yamatai's might

00:05:15.320 --> 00:05:18.050
to defeat Takeda in a surprise attack!

00:05:19.180 --> 00:05:20.470
You fool!

00:05:20.470 --> 00:05:21.370
What?

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:24.650
What good will storming them 
with a lone Giant War Armor do?

00:05:25.210 --> 00:05:26.960
In that time, the enemy's forces will

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:29.290
surround your territory, raze it to 
the ground, and ravage your people!

00:05:29.570 --> 00:05:31.090
Then what do you suggest?

00:05:31.090 --> 00:05:32.230
We have already taken 
certain measures.

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:37.630
We have already ordered 300 War 
Armor units from Takamagahara.

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:39.980
Until those units arrive,

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:42.640
we will make use of Yamatai's resources 
and focus on defending our land.

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:45.710
It's not just about the Takeda 
and the Uesugi anymore!

00:05:45.710 --> 00:05:47.500
There's movement on 
the Star of the West, too!

00:05:48.060 --> 00:05:51.150
What if a horde of Giant War 
Armors came bearing down on us?!

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:54.190
We have no time to lose!

00:05:54.190 --> 00:05:57.460
You can't change this nation 
through flights of fancy.

00:05:57.460 --> 00:05:59.710
Do you accuse me of being delusional?

00:06:00.410 --> 00:06:03.350
Our alliance with the Yamatai 
is an established fact.

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:06.660
I believe our first step in 
widely demonstrating this fact

00:06:06.660 --> 00:06:08.390
to our neighboring nations

00:06:08.390 --> 00:06:11.470
should be having Nobunaga-sama 
wed Queen Himiko.

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:12.610
Wait!

00:06:13.020 --> 00:06:15.510
Our nation has only lasted this long

00:06:15.510 --> 00:06:17.710
thanks to our efforts as 
Nobuhide-sama's advisors.

00:06:17.970 --> 00:06:20.050
Do you think to let Nobunaga-sama

00:06:20.050 --> 00:06:22.480
take all the credit for 
the alliance with Yamatai?

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:23.730
Not for a moment!

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:25.710
I have an excellent idea.

00:06:26.370 --> 00:06:30.220
Hold a betrothal ceremony 
instead of wedding.

00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:35.500
The West has a policy called 
a "cooling off" period.

00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:37.320
It is a trial period of sorts.

00:06:37.320 --> 00:06:38.360
But...

00:06:39.610 --> 00:06:42.370
First, a Giant War Armor from the West,

00:06:42.370 --> 00:06:44.070
and now an alliance with Yamatai...

00:06:44.490 --> 00:06:47.040
We may have underestimated 
him as a simple fool.

00:06:47.210 --> 00:06:50.140
Still, if we can dispose of 
Nobunaga-sama in some way,

00:06:50.140 --> 00:06:52.540
Queen Himiko will marry...

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:53.850
...Nobukatsu-sama.

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:00.620
Betrothal?!

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:03.850
Why isn't it a wedding?

00:07:03.850 --> 00:07:06.100
That was not our agreement!

00:07:10.090 --> 00:07:11.300
My betrothed!

00:07:17.880 --> 00:07:18.890
Is he over there?

00:07:21.190 --> 00:07:23.890
So, what do you want?

00:07:24.800 --> 00:07:26.980
Is this how Westerners sneak into each other's rooms at night to get some?

00:07:27.120 --> 00:07:28.970
D-Don't be ridiculous!

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:34.450
I just want to learn Eastern swordsmanship!

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:37.920
I will determine whether this man

00:07:38.740 --> 00:07:39.860
is the true Savior-King!

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:45.140
Put more force behind the blade!

00:07:46.170 --> 00:07:47.600
That sword's looking down on you!

00:07:50.430 --> 00:07:51.800
Look right back at it!

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:55.980
I will decide whether the heavens 
have guided me to the truth!

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:06.950
Why else did I come all 
the way to this star?!

00:08:17.550 --> 00:08:19.270
Wh-What?!

00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:22.530
I don't have time to humor 
someone who lacks focus.

00:08:27.100 --> 00:08:28.780
I couldn't do anything...

00:08:28.780 --> 00:08:29.360
Huh?

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:31.470
The forest and village were on fire,

00:08:31.470 --> 00:08:33.010
but I couldn't...

00:08:33.890 --> 00:08:35.340
I did that.

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:37.360
It has nothing to do with you.

00:08:37.360 --> 00:08:38.260
But...

00:08:38.960 --> 00:08:41.580
How do you expect to kill 
people if you think that way?

00:08:42.100 --> 00:08:43.470
The entire world is at war.

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:46.820
Only those who create their 
own destiny can survive!

00:08:48.140 --> 00:08:50.650
The blade's purpose is to sever 
yourself from your doubts.

00:08:51.970 --> 00:08:53.800
D-Doubts...

00:08:55.240 --> 00:08:56.570
My betrothed!

00:08:56.990 --> 00:08:59.440
What is this talk of a betrothal? 
That's not what we agreed...

00:09:00.400 --> 00:09:02.220
Who is this gold-headed one?

00:09:02.220 --> 00:09:03.010
Him?

00:09:03.010 --> 00:09:05.710
He's one of my men, Mori Ranmaru.

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:07.640
Mori Ranmaru?

00:09:12.230 --> 00:09:15.050
Um, m-may I help you?

00:09:15.730 --> 00:09:16.690
Excuse me.

00:09:18.960 --> 00:09:19.750
What are you doing?!

00:09:19.750 --> 00:09:21.350
I knew you were a woman.

00:09:21.350 --> 00:09:23.630
Begone, golden corn-head!

00:09:23.630 --> 00:09:25.770
Stay away from my betrothed!

00:09:25.770 --> 00:09:29.770
Ha! Even the Queen of Yamatai gets jealous?

00:09:29.770 --> 00:09:31.860
I am not jealous.

00:09:31.860 --> 00:09:33.800
I just do not wish this

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:36.280
holy land to be defiled 
by this perverted woman!

00:09:36.280 --> 00:09:37.670
Perverted?!

00:09:37.670 --> 00:09:40.480
Pretending to be a man so you 
can get close to my betrothed—

00:09:40.480 --> 00:09:42.140
how else would you describe such a person?

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:43.560
W-Wait...

00:09:43.560 --> 00:09:45.310
There are reasons for this.

00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:46.480
Don't tell anyone.

00:09:46.950 --> 00:09:47.760
Oh?

00:09:48.670 --> 00:09:51.960
I do not take any pleasure in 
having this one stay by your side,

00:09:51.960 --> 00:09:53.920
but knowing a secret is not a bad thing.

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:55.290
Very well!

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:58.540
But do not hold my betrothed back!

00:09:58.540 --> 00:10:01.240
You Westerners are barbarians, after all!

00:10:01.680 --> 00:10:02.730
How rude!

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:06.020
I heard that Westerners are cannibals!

00:10:06.020 --> 00:10:07.450
That's a lie.

00:10:07.450 --> 00:10:09.010
You Easterners have necks 
that stretch out at night

00:10:09.010 --> 00:10:11.390
so that you can drink oil 
from lanterns, don't you?

00:10:11.390 --> 00:10:13.680
Don't talk about us like we're monsters!

00:10:15.060 --> 00:10:16.010
My betrothed?!

00:10:15.060 --> 00:10:16.010
Nobunaga!

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:19.220
We're not done talking yet!

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:26.420
It is designed to run automatically 
using metal springs...

00:10:26.420 --> 00:10:28.360
But unfortunately, I do not have any.

00:10:29.320 --> 00:10:31.680
I hope I can find some that are 
constructed of a material strong

00:10:31.680 --> 00:10:33.110
enough to stand up to this one.

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:35.260
No, if it's too rigid, it'll just crack.

00:10:37.300 --> 00:10:39.810
You need flexibility, as well.

00:10:42.510 --> 00:10:43.860
What do you think?

00:10:43.860 --> 00:10:45.700
This is wondrous.

00:10:46.170 --> 00:10:48.650
Sir Hiraga, you and your colleagues on this

00:10:48.650 --> 00:10:51.040
planet possess excellent craftsmanship, 
not to mention creativity.

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:56.950
This will allow me to create new 
War Armors in the near future.

00:11:00.880 --> 00:11:02.160
Da Vinci-dono,

00:11:02.160 --> 00:11:06.890
could anyone other than Nobu use The Fool?

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:09.540
Well, let me think.

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:14.030
The ley lines work in 
mysterious ways on our worlds.

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:17.540
The fact that this unit 
accepted Sir Nobunaga...

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:20.240
...was not coincidence, but an inevitability.

00:11:20.750 --> 00:11:22.600
Then what about me?

00:11:24.020 --> 00:11:27.030
Can you make a shiny War Armor unit for me?

00:11:28.160 --> 00:11:29.870
I will consider it.

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:32.220
Da Vinci-dono.

00:11:32.900 --> 00:11:37.350
What about Nobu? That is, what are 
your thoughts regarding Nobunaga?

00:11:38.110 --> 00:11:40.200
I wish to determine...

00:11:40.750 --> 00:11:44.700
whether Sir Nobunaga is a golden dragon 
that will unify heaven and earth,

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:47.540
or if he is merely a paper mole 
clad in glamorous illusion.

00:11:49.300 --> 00:11:50.690
Sir Mitsuhide,

00:11:51.570 --> 00:11:53.670
do you happen to have an 
interest in things such as these?

00:11:54.510 --> 00:11:56.850
There is a hidden melody 
born of the unseen world.

00:11:57.130 --> 00:11:59.560
These symbols illuminate that sacred melody.

00:12:00.420 --> 00:12:02.250
What, you're not going to pick one?

00:12:02.250 --> 00:12:03.800
Then I will!

00:12:06.920 --> 00:12:07.670
Huh?

00:12:07.670 --> 00:12:08.770
What the?

00:12:11.280 --> 00:12:14.560
It does not appear to yet be time 
for you to draw one, Sir Hideyoshi.

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:15.800
Go on.

00:12:20.600 --> 00:12:21.470
What is this?

00:12:23.460 --> 00:12:26.170
The Magician reversed.

00:12:26.170 --> 00:12:28.970
When this man becomes able to manipulate

00:12:28.970 --> 00:12:32.900
the four elements—earth, water, 
fire, and wind—at will,

00:12:32.900 --> 00:12:34.960
he will become a true magician.

00:12:34.960 --> 00:12:38.350
But the reversal means 
that he is not yet ready.

00:12:38.350 --> 00:12:39.920
Is Nobu the Magician?

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:41.890
By the way, Sir Mitsuhide,

00:12:42.210 --> 00:12:45.420
I'd like to seek your counsel 
regarding the betrothal ceremony

00:12:45.420 --> 00:12:47.390
between Sir Nobunaga and Lady Himiko...

00:12:56.050 --> 00:12:57.600
This pillow's rock hard...

00:12:57.600 --> 00:12:59.370
The woven grass is smelly...

00:13:00.240 --> 00:13:01.710
The ceiling's too high.

00:13:03.220 --> 00:13:05.160
And these pajamas...

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:14.750
Much better!

00:13:29.760 --> 00:13:30.750
Wait!

00:13:31.560 --> 00:13:33.240
What? What's wrong?

00:13:33.570 --> 00:13:35.240
That bridge isn't safe!

00:13:35.240 --> 00:13:36.450
It's gonna break!

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:38.720
Huh? What're you talking about?

00:13:38.720 --> 00:13:40.080
Weirdo!

00:13:48.550 --> 00:13:49.590
What's the matter?

00:13:49.590 --> 00:13:51.650
Jeanne made the bridge fall!

00:13:51.650 --> 00:13:53.310
What? That little girl?

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:54.500
That's not possible...

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:58.090
But, she said it was gonna fall!

00:13:58.090 --> 00:13:59.180
What?

00:14:20.220 --> 00:14:21.590
What a beautiful song...

00:14:23.450 --> 00:14:24.860
Are you having trouble getting to sleep?

00:14:25.090 --> 00:14:26.720
Y-Yes...

00:14:26.720 --> 00:14:29.420
Things here must be very different 
than they were in the Star of the West.

00:14:29.420 --> 00:14:30.640
If you are uncomfortable in any way,

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:32.630
please do not hesitate 
to come to me for help.

00:14:32.630 --> 00:14:34.100
Thank you.

00:14:36.860 --> 00:14:40.200
Ah, if I may ask you a question...

00:14:40.200 --> 00:14:40.640
Yes?

00:14:41.260 --> 00:14:45.450
How does my brother appear 
to someone from the West?

00:14:45.450 --> 00:14:46.230
What?

00:14:48.880 --> 00:14:50.910
May I be frank?

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:51.640
Yes.

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:56.980
Selfish, arrogant, and violent to boot!

00:14:56.980 --> 00:14:59.150
A huge idiot who has no 
concern for anyone else!

00:14:59.150 --> 00:15:02.530
A total blockhead!

00:15:04.540 --> 00:15:05.780
Oh, my...

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:11.580
My brother has always been rambunctious 
since he was a small child,

00:15:11.580 --> 00:15:13.940
troubling those around him.

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:17.280
It seems you are bewildered by him, as well.

00:15:18.030 --> 00:15:19.450
No, I...

00:15:21.750 --> 00:15:25.100
Having such a fool for a brother...

00:15:25.100 --> 00:15:26.460
Does it not make you sad?

00:15:27.120 --> 00:15:29.590
Why would I be sad?

00:15:29.590 --> 00:15:30.390
What?

00:15:30.740 --> 00:15:35.130
Others just do not see his true self.

00:15:36.190 --> 00:15:37.790
His true self...

00:15:45.620 --> 00:15:47.790
Welcome home, Brother.

00:15:49.160 --> 00:15:50.870
You killed all of them with one shot.

00:15:51.370 --> 00:15:53.180
They didn't have to suffer, then.

00:15:54.640 --> 00:15:57.650
Brother, I must congratulate 
you on your engagement.

00:15:57.650 --> 00:15:59.930
It's nothing to congratulate me about.

00:16:00.670 --> 00:16:02.580
I just wanted the Regalia.

00:16:03.340 --> 00:16:05.660
That woman is just extra.

00:16:05.660 --> 00:16:06.620
Want to eat?

00:16:06.620 --> 00:16:08.200
No, I am quite all right.

00:16:11.130 --> 00:16:13.000
I envy you, Brother.

00:16:13.980 --> 00:16:18.170
I lack the courage to live 
the carefree way that you do.

00:16:18.560 --> 00:16:20.230
I am always mindful of 
how others perceive me,

00:16:20.230 --> 00:16:22.060
and I wish to live up to their expectations.

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:25.110
But I am not actually able to do so.

00:16:25.760 --> 00:16:27.760
I feel as though I will be 
crushed by their expectations.

00:16:27.760 --> 00:16:28.880
Ridiculous!

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:35.220
Brother...

00:16:35.910 --> 00:16:38.380
Your life is your own.

00:16:38.750 --> 00:16:41.060
How can you not live your 
own life as you see fit?

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:44.230
If you just wait for life 
to happen... you'll die.

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:46.630
That's the thing.

00:16:46.630 --> 00:16:49.920
I envy you because you can say 
such things with such conviction.

00:17:10.160 --> 00:17:11.050
Look here!

00:17:11.050 --> 00:17:12.690
The biggest fool in the world,

00:17:12.690 --> 00:17:16.690
Oda Nobunaga, will become betrothed 
to Queen Himiko of Yamatai!

00:17:16.690 --> 00:17:18.900
It's worth a listen even if you're far away,

00:17:18.900 --> 00:17:21.000
and if you're closer,
 it's definitely worth a look!

00:17:21.420 --> 00:17:23.970
It might be the biggest 
event you'll ever see!

00:17:23.970 --> 00:17:25.330
Don't miss out!

00:17:25.330 --> 00:17:27.180
Who knew we'd ever get to 
see that notorious fool?

00:17:27.180 --> 00:17:28.370
The Queen of Yamatai!

00:17:28.370 --> 00:17:32.160
Oh, travelers, make sure 
you pay the viewing fee.

00:17:32.160 --> 00:17:35.180
Residents get in free, but you have to pay.

00:17:35.430 --> 00:17:37.450
What, you're gonna charge us?!

00:17:39.150 --> 00:17:40.440
That Hideyoshi...

00:17:40.920 --> 00:17:44.660
I'd like to believe that he's collecting 
military funds for us, but...

00:17:45.220 --> 00:17:48.160
Still, who knew such a 
large crowd would gather?

00:17:49.790 --> 00:17:52.390
Is it thanks to da Vinci-dono's 
flair for theatrics?

00:17:53.530 --> 00:17:56.440
Or, is it Nobu's power as the Magician?

00:17:58.760 --> 00:18:00.880
M-Messieurs et Mesdames.

00:18:00.880 --> 00:18:03.070
We will now begin the

00:18:03.070 --> 00:18:07.350
betrothal ceremony of Oda Nobunaga 
and Queen Himiko of Yamatai.

00:18:07.960 --> 00:18:09.020
Thank you for your help.

00:18:09.430 --> 00:18:12.960
We are quite ignorant of Western customs.

00:18:12.960 --> 00:18:16.290
Why am I helping Nobunaga with his betrothal?

00:18:22.310 --> 00:18:26.200
There, a great opportunity to 
assimilate Western technology!

00:18:37.210 --> 00:18:38.480
Congratulations 
on Your Betrothal!

00:18:39.020 --> 00:18:40.060
This...

00:18:40.060 --> 00:18:43.320
What foolishness it is, pouring 
money into such pretense!

00:18:43.320 --> 00:18:45.920
It is incomparable to our nation of Kai...

00:18:59.860 --> 00:19:01.000
This song...

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:03.680
I asked it of her.

00:19:04.780 --> 00:19:05.940
Ichihime-sama...

00:19:22.100 --> 00:19:24.810
Now, the main attraction 
will finally appear.

00:19:26.130 --> 00:19:28.050
My throat's not doing so well...

00:19:28.050 --> 00:19:29.800
Then I'll step in.

00:19:30.410 --> 00:19:32.730
Get a good look, you guys!

00:19:32.730 --> 00:19:35.600
It's the Queen of Yamatai!

00:19:35.930 --> 00:19:37.350
A wedding dress?

00:19:37.760 --> 00:19:40.110
Why is she dressed like a Westerner?

00:19:40.110 --> 00:19:42.580
Let us go with the flow.

00:19:43.080 --> 00:19:46.920
I hope this will help Nobunaga 
settle down somewhat.

00:19:47.340 --> 00:19:51.890
Next comes our own hero, Nobunaga-sama!

00:19:54.300 --> 00:19:56.170
That fool.

00:19:56.170 --> 00:19:57.990
But it's how he is.

00:20:12.980 --> 00:20:15.320
How noble.

00:20:16.290 --> 00:20:17.460
Now, my betrothed!

00:20:17.460 --> 00:20:19.810
Seal our betrothal with a passionate kiss!

00:20:19.810 --> 00:20:22.100
A kiss? Here?

00:20:22.590 --> 00:20:24.610
I learned from da Vinci-dono

00:20:24.610 --> 00:20:27.570
that it's a custom in Western weddings.

00:20:34.900 --> 00:20:36.040
Come, hurry!

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:38.670
This is our wedding ceremony.

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:40.490
Why are you dressed like that?

00:20:40.490 --> 00:20:43.170
I thought you believed 
Westerners were barbarians.

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:46.700
Barbarians or not, they have 
some things of value to offer.

00:20:47.870 --> 00:20:48.800
Fine!

00:20:50.590 --> 00:20:51.550
What?!

00:20:55.530 --> 00:20:57.650
So you <i>do</i> remember, my betrothed!

00:20:58.270 --> 00:21:00.060
What're you so happy about?

00:21:02.290 --> 00:21:04.530
I shall be satisfied with this for now.

00:21:04.760 --> 00:21:08.140
Hey, is that how Westerners show affection?

00:21:08.140 --> 00:21:09.410
Who knows?!

00:21:11.680 --> 00:21:14.280
The event isn't over yet.

00:21:14.280 --> 00:21:15.000
What?

00:21:20.810 --> 00:21:23.740
Honored guests, please observe 
the happy couple's...

00:21:23.740 --> 00:21:26.320
The happy couple's first task together,

00:21:26.320 --> 00:21:28.020
the cutting of the cake!

00:21:30.300 --> 00:21:31.980
Pointless.

00:21:35.850 --> 00:21:38.090
Ah! My betrothed!

00:21:47.310 --> 00:21:48.370
Brother...

00:22:07.190 --> 00:22:08.320
Father...

00:22:16.420 --> 00:22:17.740
The power of the Magician...

00:22:22.620 --> 00:22:24.160
A raging beast...

00:22:24.780 --> 00:22:27.240
You are indeed my betrothed.

00:24:12.330 --> 00:24:13.730
<i>I lost my father,</i>

00:24:13.730 --> 00:24:15.700
<i>as well as my clan of Akechi.</i>

00:24:16.340 --> 00:24:17.990
<i>Nobu's quest to unify the land</i>

00:24:17.990 --> 00:24:19.890
<i>is also his battle to surpass his father.</i>

00:24:20.880 --> 00:24:22.620
<i>Next time: The Tower.</i>

00:24:22.910 --> 00:24:25.330
<i>Rain, wash away the tears.</i>
